# The Void POS backend this till talks to. The mobile till calls the API directly (unlike the
# web till, which proxies /api on its own origin), so this must be an absolute URL the device
# can reach. Copy this file to `.env` and adjust. Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* at build time.
#
#   iOS simulator     http://localhost:8000      (shares the Mac's network)
#   Android emulator  http://10.0.2.2:8000        (the emulator's alias for the host machine)
#   Real device       http://<your-LAN-ip>:8000   e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8000
#
# For a non-localhost base the API must allow this origin — start it with VOIDPOS_CORS_ORIGINS
# covering the URL above. Without this variable the app defaults to http://localhost:8000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
